ource-30764-30797">にいたるまで此雪此国に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30797-30812"><rb>降</rb><rt>ふら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30812-30839">ざる事なし。されば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30839-30863"><rb>暖国</rb><rt>だんこく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30863-30890">の人のごとく初雪を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30890-30902"><rb>観</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30902-30905">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30905-30929"><rb>吟詠</rb><rt>ぎんえい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30929-30956"><rb>遊興</rb><rt>いうきよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30956-30974">のたのしみは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30974-30989"><rb>夢</rb><rt>ゆめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30989-31007">にもしらず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31007-31028"><rb>今年</rb><rt>ことし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31028-31037">も又此</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31037-31067"><rb>雪中</rb><rt>ゆきのなか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31067-31070">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31070-31082"><rb>在</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31082-31100">る事かと雪を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31100-31121"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かなしむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31121-31124">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31124-31151"><rb>辺郷</rb><rt>へんきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31151-31154">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31154-31178"><rb>寒国</rb><rt>かんこく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31178-31181">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31181-31199"><rb>生</rb><rt>うまれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31199-31235">たる不幸といふべし。雪を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31235-31247"><rb>観</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-31247-31250">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-31250-31268"><rb>楽</rb><r