          <p source="#source-111725-114667"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111725-111749"><rb>或人</rb><rt>あるひと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111749-111767"><rb>問</rb><rt>とふて</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111767-111785"><rb>曰</rb><rt>いはく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111785-111794">、雪の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111794-111812"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111812-111836"><rb>六出</rb><rt>むつかど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111836-111845">なるは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111845-111860"><rb>前</rb><rt>まえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111860-111863">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111863-111878"><rb>弁</rb><rt>べん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111878-111887">ありて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111887-111911"><rb>詳</rb><rt>つまびらか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111911-111917">也。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111917-111938"><rb>雪頽</rb><rt>なだれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111938-111947">は雪の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111947-111968"><rb>塊</rb><rt>かたまり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111968-111980">ならん、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111980-111998"><rb>砕</rb><rt>くだけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111998-112004">たる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112004-112022"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112022-112028">雪の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112028-112052"><rb>六出</rb><rt>むつかど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112052-112058">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112058-112082"><rb>本形</rb><rt>ほんけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112082-112100">をうしなひて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112100-112124"><rb>方形</rb><rt>かどだつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11212