 source="#source-142385-142403"><rb>縮</rb><rt>ちゞみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142403-142406">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142406-142421"><rb>親</rb><rt>おや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142421-142439">といふべし。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142439-142454"><rb>蓋</rb><rt>けだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142454-142457">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142457-142481"><rb>薄雪</rb><rt>はくせつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142481-142490">の地に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142490-142505"><rb>布</rb><rt>ぬの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142505-142508">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142508-142532"><rb>名産</rb><rt>めいさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142532-142553">あるよしは糸の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142553-142568"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142568-142601">りによる事也。越後縮に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142601-142616"><rb>比</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142616-142622">べて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-142622-142634"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-142634-142650">るべし。</seg></p>
