        <div>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-148484-150069"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148487-148529"><rb>貴重尊用</rb><rt>きちようそんよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148529-148559">の縮をおるには、家の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148559-148574"><rb>辺</rb><rt>ほと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148574-148616">りにつもりし雪をもその心して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148616-148631"><rb>掘</rb><rt>ほり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148631-148640">すて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148640-148661"><rb>住居</rb><rt>すまゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148661-148685">の内にてなるたけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148685-148703"><rb>烟</rb><rt>けふり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148703-148715">の入らぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148715-148730"><rb>明</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148730-148742">りもよき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148742-148763"><rb>一間</rb><rt>ひとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148763-148772">をよく</seg><choice source="#source-148772-148778"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148778-148793"><rb>清</rb><rt>きよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148793-148814">め、あたらしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148814-148832"><rb>筵</rb><rt>むしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148832-148859">をしきならべ四方に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148859-148877"><rb>注連</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148877-148904">をひきわたし、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148904-148931"><rb>中央</rb><rt>ちゆうあう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148931-148934">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148934-148949"><rb>機</rb><rt>はた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148949-148952">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148952-148967"><rb>建</rb><rt>たつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148967-148973">る、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148973-148988"><rb>是</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148988-148991">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148991-149018"><rb>御機屋</rb><rt>おはたや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149018-149021">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149021-149036"><rb>唱</rb><rt>とな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149036-149042">へて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149042-149057"><rb>神</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149057-149060">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149060-149078"><rb>在</rb><rt>います</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149078-149090">がごとく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149090-149120"><rb>畏尊</rb><rt>おそれうやま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149120-149126">ひ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149126-149147"><rb>織人</rb><rt>おりて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149147-149150">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149150-149165"><rb>外</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149165-149186">他人を入れず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149186-149213"><rb>織女</rb><rt>おるをんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149213-149216">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149216-149240"><rb>別火</rb><rt>べつくわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149240-149243">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149243-149261"><rb>食</rb><rt>しよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149261-149267">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149267-149288"><rb>御機</rb><rt>おはた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149288-149330">にかゝる時は衣服をあらため、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149330-149357"><rb>塩垢離</rb><rt>しほこり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149357-149369">をとり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149369-149390"><rb>盥</rb><rt>てあらひ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149390-149411"><rb>漱</rb><rt>くちそゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149411-149420">ぎこと</seg><choice source="#source-149420-149429"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice><seg source="#source-149429-149432">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149432-149444"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149444-149447">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149447-149462"><rb>清</rb><rt>きよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149462-149468">む、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149468-149489"><rb>日毎</rb><rt>ひごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149489-149513">にかくのごとし。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149513-149543"><rb>紅潮</rb><rt>つきのさはり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149543-149558">をいむ事は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149558-149582"><rb>勿論</rb><rt>もちろん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149582-149588">也。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149588-149600"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149600-149615">の娘らなど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149615-149633"><rb>今日</rb><rt>けふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149633-149636">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149636-149651"><rb>誰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149651-149660">どのゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149660-149687"><rb>御機屋</rb><rt>おはたや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149687-149690">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149690-149708"><rb>拝</rb><rt>をがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149708-149747">にまゐるなどやうにいふ也。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149747-149768"><rb>至極</rb><rt>しごく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149768-149816">上手の女にあらざれば此おはたやを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149816-149831"><rb>建</rb><rt>たつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149831-149852">る事なければ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149852-149864"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149864-149867">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149867-149888"><rb>婦女</rb><rt>ふぢよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149888-149903">らがこれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149903-149924"><rb>羨</rb><rt>うらやむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149924-149930">事、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149930-149951"><rb>比諭</rb><rt>たとへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149951-149954">ば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149954-149975"><rb>階下</rb><rt>かいか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149975-149987">にありて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149987-150014"><rb>昇殿</rb><rt>しようでん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150014-150017">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150017-150035"><rb>位</rb><rt>くらゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150035-150069">をうらやむがごとし。</seg></p>
        </div>
