            <head n="2" source="#source-184688-184793"><seg source="#source-184688-184694">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-184694-184718"><rb>秋山</rb><rt>あきやま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-184718-184721">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-184721-184742"><rb>古風</rb><rt>こふう</rt></ruby></head>
