            <head n="2" source="#source-238929-239040"><seg source="#source-238929-238935">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-238935-238950"><rb>鮭</rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-238950-238953">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-238953-238965"><rb>字</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-238965-238968">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-238968-238989"><rb>考</rb><rt>かうがへ</rt></ruby></head>
