            <head n="2" source="#source-247874-248029"><seg source="#source-247895-247901">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-247901-247960"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-247901-247948">鮏</g></rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-247960-247963">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-247963-247978"><rb>出</rb><rt>いだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-247978-247981">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-247981-247999"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby></head>
