            <head n="2" source="#source-251594-251743"><seg source="#source-251615-251621">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-251621-251680"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-251621-251668">鮏</g></rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-251680-251683">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-251683-251713"><rb>始終</rb><rt>はじめをはり</rt></ruby></head>
