            <head n="2" source="#source-279807-279962"><seg source="#source-279828-279834">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-279834-279902"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-279834-279881">鮏</g><seg source="#source-279881-279884">漁</seg></rb><rt>さけとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-279902-279905">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-279905-279932"><rb>類術</rb><rt>るゐじゆつ</rt></ruby></head>
