        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-281295-282636"><seg source="#source-281295-281322">さけのすばしりは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281322-281346"><rb>雪前</rb><rt>ゆきまへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281346-281349">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281349-281370"><rb>河原</rb><rt>かはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281370-281430">などにある事也。かれあみにせめられ人にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281430-281442"><rb>追</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281442-281469">はれなどして、水を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281469-281493"><rb>飛離</rb><rt>とびはな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281493-281520">れて河原にのぼり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281520-281535"><rb>網</rb><rt>あみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281535-281586">ある所をこえて水にとび入りてあみを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281586-281601"><rb>退</rb><rt>のが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281601-281625">るゝ也。此時は大</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-281625-281672">鮏</g><seg source="#source-281672-281735">さきにすゝみて水をはなるれば、よりゐたる小</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-281735-281782">鮏</g><seg source="#source-281782-281788">など</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281788-281803"><rb>后</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281803-281806">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281806-281824"><rb>随</rb><rt>したが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281824-281869">ひてのぼり、河原をはしる事四五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281869-281887"><rb>間</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281887-281911">にすぎざれども、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281911-281923"><rb>箭</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281923-281995">のごとくして人の足もおよびがたし。さきにすゝむ大</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-281995-282042">鮏</g><seg source="#source-282042-282069">、もし物にさはりて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282069-282084"><rb>横</rb><rt>よこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282084-282087">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282087-282102"><rb>倒</rb><rt>たふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282102-282144">るゝ時は、あとにしたがひたる</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-39" source="#source-282144-282191">鮏</g><seg source="#source-282191-282248">もおなじくたふれてふたゝびおきず、人の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282248-282266"><rb>捕</rb><rt>とらふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282266-282272">るを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282272-282287"><rb>俟</rb><rt>まつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282287-282326">がごとし。はからずして手も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282326-282341"><rb>濡</rb><rt>ぬら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282341-282353">さず二三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282353-282371"><rb>頭</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282371-282407">のさけをうる事あり。かれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282407-282422"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282422-282437"><rb>無</rb><rt>なく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282437-282461">して地をはしり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282461-282476"><rb>倒</rb><rt>たふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282476-282494">れてふたゝび</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282494-282509"><rb>起</rb><rt>おき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282509-282524">ざるなど、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282524-282548"><rb>魚族</rb><rt>ぎよぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282548-282551">中</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282551-282569"><rb>比</rb><rt>たぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282569-282593">ふべきものなきは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-282593-282614"><rb>奇魚</rb><rt>きぎよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-282614-282636">といふべし。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-282636-282730" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
