            <head n="2" source="#source-295482-295590"><seg source="#source-295482-295488">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-295488-295515"><rb>寒行</rb><rt>かんぎやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-295515-295518">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-295518-295539"><rb>威徳</rb><rt>ゐとく</rt></ruby></head>
