            <head n="2" source="#source-327662-327773"><seg source="#source-327662-327674">○　雪に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-327674-327695"><rb>坐頭</rb><rt>ざとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-327695-327698">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-327698-327713"><rb>降</rb><rt>ふら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-327713-327716">す</seg></head>
