            <head n="2" source="#source-418842-418944"><seg source="#source-418842-418848">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-418848-418875"><rb>春寒</rb><rt>しゆんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-418875-418878">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-418878-418896"><rb>力</rb><rt>ちから</rt></ruby></head>
