          <p source="#source-420369-420505"><seg n="2" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-420369-420429"><seg source="#source-420369-420381">○　シガ</seg></seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-420429-420501" corresp="#source-420463-420501"><seg source="#source-420429-420432">＊</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-420432-420463" corresp="#source-420434-420463"><seg source="#source-420432-420434">10</seg></hi></hi></p>
