          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-482331-482415"><seg source="#source-482331-482337">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482337-482370"><rb>化石渓</rb><rt>くわせきたに</rt></ruby></head>
