            <head n="2" source="#source-525407-525596"><seg source="#source-525407-525428">○　てんぷらの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-525428-525443"><rb>説</rb><rt>せつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-525443-525455">　　○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-525455-525488"><rb>煉羊羹</rb><rt>ねりやうかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-525488-525491">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-525491-525512"><rb>起原</rb><rt>きげん</rt></ruby></head>
