            <head n="2" source="#source-618905-619010"><seg source="#source-618905-618911">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-618911-618932"><rb>田代</rb><rt>たしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-618932-618941">の七ツ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-618941-618956"><rb>釜</rb><rt>かま</rt></ruby></head>
