          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-631073-631157"><seg source="#source-631073-631079">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631079-631112"><rb>火浣布</rb><rt>くわくわんふ</rt></ruby></head>
