          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-638528-638624"><seg source="#source-638528-638534">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638534-638558"><rb>土中</rb><rt>どちゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638558-638561">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638561-638576"><rb>舟</rb><rt>ふね</rt></ruby></head>
