        <div>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-638628-639638"><seg source="#source-638628-638649">蒲原郡五泉の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638649-638664"><rb>在</rb><rt>ざい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638664-638682">一里ばかりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638682-638715"><rb>下新田</rb><rt>しもしんでん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638715-638760">といふ村あり。或年此村の者ども</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-3-61" source="#source-638760-638806">㕝</g><seg source="#source-638806-638827">ありて阿加川の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638827-638842"><rb>岸</rb><rt>きし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638842-638845">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638845-638860"><rb>掘</rb><rt>ほり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638860-638869">しに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638869-638893"><rb>土中</rb><rt>どちゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638893-638947">より長さ三間ばかりの船を掘いだせり。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638947-638971"><rb>全体</rb><rt>ぜんたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638971-638980">少しも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-638980-638998"><rb>腐</rb><rt>くさら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-638998-639004">ず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639004-639022"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639022-639034">今の船に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639034-639052"><rb>異</rb><rt>ことな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639052-639073">るのみならず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639073-639094"><rb>金具</rb><rt>かなぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639094-639118">を用うべき処みな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639118-639136"><rb>鯨</rb><rt>くぢら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639136-639139">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639139-639154"><rb>髭</rb><rt>ひげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639154-639166">を用ひて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639166-639190"><rb>寸鉄</rb><rt>すんでつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639190-639256">をもほどこしたる処なし。木もまた何の木なるを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639256-639271"><rb>弁</rb><rt>べん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639271-639304">ずる者なく、おそらくは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639304-639325"><rb>異国</rb><rt>いこく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639325-639361">の船ならんといへりとぞ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639361-639373"><rb>余</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639373-639388"><rb>下</rb><rt>しも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639388-639508">越後に遊びし時、杉田村小野佐五右エ門が家にてかの船の木にて作りたる硯箱を見しに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639508-639532"><rb>木質</rb><rt>もくしつ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639532-639556"><rb>漢産</rb><rt>かんさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639556-639595">ともおもはれき。上古漂流の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639595-639616"><rb>夷船</rb><rt>いせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-639616-639638">にやあらん。</seg></p>
        </div>
