            <head n="2" source="#source-651127-651244"><seg source="#source-651127-651133">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-651133-651190"><rb>蛾眉山下橋柱</rb><rt>がびさんかのはしばしら</rt></ruby></head>
