            <head n="2" source="#source-677707-677815"><seg source="#source-677707-677713">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-677713-677728"><rb>鶴</rb><rt>つる</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-677728-677743"><rb>恩</rb><rt>おん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-677743-677746">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-677746-677761"><rb>報</rb><rt>むく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-677761-677764">ゆ</seg></head>
