          <p source="#source-680913-681156"><seg source="#source-680913-680925">通巻画図</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-680925-681156" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(9)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=9"><seg source="#source-680955-680967">京水　　</seg><hi rend="font-size large(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=large;level=1" source="#source-680967-681051" corresp="#source-680967-681000 #source-681018-681051"><seg source="#source-681000-681018">岩瀬百鶴　筆</seg></hi><seg source="#source-681051-681054">　</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-681054-681138"><graphic url="fig58400_55.png" width="55px" height="59px"/><figDesc>京水岩瀬百鶴の押印の図</figDesc></figure></seg></p>
